# xKiro's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-xkiro-setting-api-key = 来自您在 https://xkiro.com 账号中的 xKiro API 密钥。仅发送到 api.xkiro.com；读取用量不会消耗 Token。

## The report: the daily free tokens and the wallet balance. Plan names
## stay as xKiro sends them.

usage-xkiro-free-tokens = 免费 Token
usage-xkiro-tokens-used-today = 今日已用 Token
usage-xkiro-daily-allowance = 每日额度
# The daily allowance of an account xKiro reports no cap for.
usage-xkiro-no-cap-reported = 未报告上限
usage-xkiro-tokens-remaining = 剩余 Token
# When the free tokens reset; the value is a time of day, 00:00 UTC.
usage-xkiro-daily-reset = 每日重置
# The plan line of an account without a plan.
usage-xkiro-pay-as-you-go = 按量付费
usage-xkiro-wallet = 钱包
